<title>USA: DataTrend Inc Q3 loss widens with charge.</title>
<headline>DataTrend Inc Q3 loss widens with charge.</headline>
<dateline>SOUTH BRAINTREE, Mass. 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended</p>
<p>							 September 30,</p>
<p>						    1996		1995</p>
<p> Net Sales			     $ 8,992,463	$ 6,884,771</p>
<p> Net Income (Loss)		  (495,427)(a)	  (197,168)</p>
<p> Net Income (Loss) Per Share	 (0.11)(a)	     (0.04)</p>
<p> Weighted Average Number of Shares  4,712,795	 4,712,795</p>
<p>							Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>							  September 30,</p>
<p>						   1996		 1995</p>
<p> Net Sales				29,330,521	 20,094,648</p>
<p> Net Income (Loss)		    227,455(a)	  (350,587)</p>
<p> Net Income (Loss) Per Share	   0.05(a)	     (0.09)</p>
<p> Weighted Average Number of Shares  4,712,795	 4,189,262</p>
<p>NOTE - (a) Includes a one-time, non-cash allowance of $325,000, or $.07 per share, for an  increase for doubtful accounts, and $50,000, or $.01 per share, for legal fees related to a lawsuit filed against Jabil Circuit Inc.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
